<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Mon espace — Le Gourmet Parisien</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;1,400&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bordeaux: #6B1A2A; --bordeaux-light: #8B2A3A; --bordeaux-dark: #401018; --bordeaux-deep: #2A0A10;
      --bordeaux-pale: #f5eaec; --bordeaux-ultra: #fdf0f2;
      --or: #C9A84C; --or-light: #fdf6e3; --or-dark: #a8873a; --or-pale: rgba(201,168,76,0.12);
      --creme: #FAF6F0; --creme-dark: #EDE5D8; --creme-mid: #F3EDE4;
      --brun: #3D2B1F; --brun-light: #7A5C4A; --brun-ultra: #2a1c12;
      --blanc: #FFFFFF;
      --vert: #2e7d32; --vert-pale: #e8f5e9;
      --rouge: #c62828; --rouge-pale: #fdecea;
      --orange: #e65100; --orange-pale: #fff3e0;
      --bleu: #1565c0; --bleu-pale: #e3f2fd;
      --radius: 20px; --radius-sm: 12px; --radius-xs: 8px;
      --shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(61,43,31,0.08);
      --shadow-lg: 0 16px 56px rgba(61,43,31,0.16);
      --shadow-gold: 0 4px 24px rgba(201,168,76,0.22);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; background: var(--creme); color: var(--brun); min-height: 100vh; }

    /* ── HEADER ── */
    .hdr {
      background: var(--bordeaux-deep);
      height: 68px; padding: 0 2.5rem;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 200;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.12);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    }
    .hdr-logo { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--or); text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
    .hdr-logo span { font-style: italic; }
    .hdr-nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2.5rem; }
    .hdr-nav a { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.42); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; transition: color 0.25s; }
    .hdr-nav a:hover { color: var(--or); }
    .hdr-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; }
    .hdr-avatar {
      width: 38px; height: 38px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--or) 0%, var(--or-dark) 100%);
      color: var(--bordeaux-deep); border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.95rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-gold); cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.2s;
    }
    .hdr-avatar:hover { transform: scale(1.08); }
    .hdr-name { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 500; }
    .hdr-logout {
      width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); text-decoration: none; font-size: 1rem;
      transition: all 0.2s; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }
    .hdr-logout:hover { color: var(--rouge); border-color: rgba(198,40,40,0.3); background: rgba(198,40,40,0.08); }

    /* ── HERO ── */
    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(165deg, var(--bordeaux-deep) 0%, var(--bordeaux-dark) 45%, var(--bordeaux) 100%);
      padding: 4rem 2.5rem 7rem;
      text-align: center; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 15% 80%, rgba(201,168,76,0.09), transparent),
        radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 70% at 85% 10%, rgba(201,168,76,0.06), transparent);
    }
    /* Decorative circles */
    .hero-ring {
      position: absolute; border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.07); pointer-events: none;
    }
    .hero-ring-1 { width: 600px; height: 600px; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%,-50%); }
    .hero-ring-2 { width: 400px; height: 400px; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%,-50%); }
    .hero-ring-3 { width: 200px; height: 200px; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%,-50%); }
    .hero-wave {
      position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      height: 80px; background: var(--creme);
      clip-path: ellipse(58% 100% at 50% 100%);
    }
    .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .hero-eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem;
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.62rem; font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--or); margin-bottom: 1.25rem; opacity: 0.85;
    }
    .hero-eyebrow::before, .hero-eyebrow::after { content: ''; width: 24px; height: 1px; background: currentColor; opacity: 0.5; }
    .hero-title { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem); color: #fff; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .hero-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--or); }
    .hero-sub { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.42); font-style: italic; }

    /* ── STATS STRIP ── */
    .stats-strip {
      max-width: 1100px; margin: -2.5rem auto 0;
      padding: 0 2rem; position: relative; z-index: 10;
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1rem;
    }
    .stat-card {
      background: var(--blanc);
      border: 1px solid var(--creme-dark);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow); text-align: center;
      transition: all 0.3s; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .stat-card::after {
      content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      height: 3px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--bordeaux), var(--or));
      transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: left;
      transition: transform 0.4s ease;
    }
    .stat-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); }
    .stat-card:hover::after { transform: scaleX(1); }
    .stat-val {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--bordeaux); line-height: 1;
      transition: all 0.3s;
    }
    .stat-lbl { font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--brun-light); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; margin-top: 0.35rem; font-weight: 600; }

    /* ── MAIN CONTENT ── */
    .main { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem 2rem 6rem; }

    .section-head {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-top: 3rem;
    }
    .section-head:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
    .section-line { flex: 1; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--creme-dark), transparent); }
    .section-title { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--bordeaux); white-space: nowrap; }
    .section-badge { background: var(--bordeaux); color: #fff; font-size: 0.62rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 0.18rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 50px; }

    /* ── RESERVATION CARDS — ticket style ── */
    .res-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }

    .res-ticket {
      background: var(--blanc);
      border: 1px solid var(--creme-dark);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      display: flex; align-items: stretch;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: all 0.3s;
      position: relative;
    }
    .res-ticket:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); }
    .res-ticket::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0;
      width: 4px;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--bordeaux), var(--or));
    }

    /* Date block */
    .res-date-col {
      background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--bordeaux-dark), var(--bordeaux));
      color: #fff; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      min-width: 90px; flex-shrink: 0; position: relative;
    }
    .res-date-col::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; right: -1px; top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      border-left: 8px solid var(--creme-dark);
      border-top: 8px solid transparent;
      border-bottom: 8px solid transparent;
      display: none;
    }
    .res-day { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; }
    .res-month { font-size: 0.6rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.15em; opacity: 0.7; margin-top: 0.15rem; }
    .res-year { font-size: 0.58rem; opacity: 0.5; margin-top: 0.1rem; }

    /* Info block */
    .res-info-col { flex: 1; padding: 1.1rem 1.5rem 1.1rem 1.25rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 0.5rem; }
    .res-time { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--brun); }
    .res-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: center; }
    .res-chip {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.3rem;
      font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--brun-light);
      background: var(--creme); border: 1px solid var(--creme-dark);
      padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem; border-radius: 50px;
    }
    .res-chip-empl { background: var(--or-light); color: var(--or-dark); border-color: rgba(201,168,76,0.2); }
    .res-demande-txt { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--brun-light); }

    /* Actions */
    .res-actions-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.4rem; padding: 1rem; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-end; border-left: 1px solid var(--creme-dark); min-width: 130px; }
    .btn-ticket-edit {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem;
      background: var(--bordeaux-pale); color: var(--bordeaux);
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(107,26,42,0.12);
      padding: 0.45rem 0.9rem; border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; width: 100%; justify-content: center;
    }
    .btn-ticket-edit:hover { background: var(--bordeaux); color: #fff; }
    .btn-ticket-cancel {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem;
      background: transparent; color: var(--brun-light);
      border: 1.5px solid var(--creme-dark);
      padding: 0.45rem 0.9rem; border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 500;
      cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; width: 100%; justify-content: center;
    }
    .btn-ticket-cancel:hover { background: var(--rouge-pale); color: var(--rouge); border-color: rgba(198,40,40,0.2); }

    /* ── HISTORIQUE TABLE ── */
    .history-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
    .history-table th { padding: 0.6rem 1rem; font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--brun-light); text-align: left; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--creme-dark); }
    .history-table td { padding: 0.85rem 1rem; font-size: 0.82rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--creme-mid); vertical-align: middle; }
    .history-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    .history-table tr:hover td { background: var(--creme); }
    .history-date { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-weight: 700; color: var(--brun); }
    .history-time { color: var(--brun-light); font-size: 0.78rem; }

    .badge { font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 0.22rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 50px; white-space: nowrap; letter-spacing: 0.03em; }
    .badge-confirmee  { background: var(--vert-pale);   color: var(--vert); }
    .badge-honoree    { background: var(--bleu-pale);   color: var(--bleu); }
    .badge-annulee    { background: var(--rouge-pale);  color: var(--rouge); }
    .badge-no_show    { background: var(--orange-pale); color: var(--orange); }
    .badge-en_attente { background: var(--or-light);    color: #7a5c00; }

    /* ── CARDS GRID ── */
    .cards-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; }

    .card {
      background: var(--blanc); border: 1px solid var(--creme-dark);
      border-radius: var(--radius); overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      transition: all 0.3s;
    }
    .card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); }
    .card-head {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem;
      padding: 1.1rem 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--creme-dark);
      background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--bordeaux-ultra), var(--blanc));
    }
    .card-icon {
      width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 10px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bordeaux-pale), var(--bordeaux-ultra));
      color: var(--bordeaux); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1rem; flex-shrink: 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(107,26,42,0.1);
    }
    .card-title { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--brun); flex: 1; }
    .card-body { padding: 1.5rem; }

    /* ── PROFIL CARD ── */
    .profil-membership {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bordeaux-dark) 0%, var(--bordeaux) 60%, var(--bordeaux-light) 100%);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .profil-membership::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 80% 20%, rgba(201,168,76,0.12), transparent);
    }
    .profil-membership-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .profil-membership-label { font-size: 0.58rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: var(--or); opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; font-weight: 600; }
    .profil-membership-name { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; line-height: 1.2; }
    .profil-membership-email { font-size: 0.75rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45); margin-top: 0.25rem; }
    .profil-membership-chip {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem;
      background: rgba(201,168,76,0.18); border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.3);
      color: var(--or); font-size: 0.62rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase; padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 50px;
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
    }

    .profil-fields { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.6rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .profil-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.6rem; }
    .profil-field {
      background: var(--creme); border: 1px solid var(--creme-dark);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xs); padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .profil-field:hover { border-color: var(--bordeaux-pale); }
    .profil-field.full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    .profil-field-lbl { font-size: 0.58rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--brun-light); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
    .profil-field-val { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--brun); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem; }
    .profil-field-empty { color: var(--creme-dark); font-style: italic; font-weight: 400; font-size: 0.78rem; }

    /* ── STARS ── */
    .stars { display: flex; gap: 0.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .star-btn { font-size: 1.75rem; cursor: pointer; color: var(--creme-dark); transition: color 0.12s, transform 0.15s; background: none; border: none; padding: 0; line-height: 1; }
    .star-btn.active { color: var(--or); filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(201,168,76,0.5)); }
    .star-btn:hover { transform: scale(1.25); }
    .star-hint { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--brun-light); font-style: italic; min-height: 1.2em; }

    /* ── FORMS ── */
    .fgroup { margin-bottom: 0.875rem; }
    .flabel { display: block; font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--brun-light); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .finput {
      width: 100%; padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--creme-dark); border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--brun);
      background: var(--creme); outline: none; resize: vertical;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s, background 0.2s;
    }
    .finput:focus { border-color: var(--bordeaux); background: var(--blanc); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(107,26,42,0.07); }
    .finput.invalid { border-color: var(--rouge); background: #fff8f8; }
    .fhint { font-size: 0.67rem; color: var(--brun-light); font-style: italic; margin-top: 0.25rem; display: block; }
    .fhint.err { color: var(--rouge); }
    .fhint.ok  { color: var(--vert); }

    /* Emplacement pills */
    .empl-group { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .empl-pill {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem;
      padding: 0.45rem 0.9rem; border: 1.5px solid var(--creme-dark);
      border-radius: 50px; background: var(--creme);
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--brun-light); cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; user-select: none;
    }
    .empl-pill:hover { border-color: var(--bordeaux); color: var(--bordeaux); }
    .empl-pill.active { background: var(--bordeaux); color: #fff; border-color: var(--bordeaux); box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(107,26,42,0.2); }
    .empl-pill input { display: none; }

    /* ── BUTTONS ── */
    .btn {
      display: block; width: 100%; padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
      border: none; border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer; text-align: center; text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.25s; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }
    .btn:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .btn-primary { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bordeaux), var(--bordeaux-light)); color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 3px 14px rgba(107,26,42,0.28); }
    .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 6px 22px rgba(107,26,42,0.38); }
    .btn-subtle { background: var(--creme); color: var(--brun-light); border: 1.5px solid var(--creme-dark); font-weight: 500; }
    .btn-subtle:hover { border-color: var(--bordeaux); color: var(--bordeaux); }
    .btn-danger { background: var(--rouge-pale); color: var(--rouge); border: 1px solid rgba(198,40,40,0.2); }
    .btn-danger:hover { background: var(--rouge); color: #fff; }
    .btn-gold { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--or), var(--or-dark)); color: var(--bordeaux-dark); font-weight: 700; box-shadow: var(--shadow-gold); }
    .btn-gold:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(201,168,76,0.4); }

    .or-sep { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; margin: 0.75rem 0; color: var(--brun-light); font-size: 0.68rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; }
    .or-sep::before, .or-sep::after { content: ''; flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--creme-dark); }

    /* ── FEEDBACK ── */
    .fbk { display: none; padding: 0.8rem 1rem; border-radius: var(--radius-xs); font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .fbk.ok  { background: var(--vert-pale); color: var(--vert); border: 1px solid rgba(46,125,50,0.2); }
    .fbk.err { background: var(--rouge-pale); color: var(--rouge); border: 1px solid rgba(198,40,40,0.2); }

    /* ── EMPTY ── */
    .empty {
      text-align: center; padding: 3rem 2rem; color: var(--brun-light);
      background: var(--blanc); border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      border: 1px dashed var(--creme-dark);
    }
    .empty-icon { font-size: 2.5rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; opacity: 0.3; }
    .empty p { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }

    /* ── SKELETON ── */
    .skeleton { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--creme-dark) 25%, var(--creme-mid) 50%, var(--creme-dark) 75%); background-size: 200% 100%; animation: shimmer 1.4s infinite; border-radius: 6px; }
    @keyframes shimmer { 0% { background-position: 200% 0; } 100% { background-position: -200% 0; } }
    .skel-ticket { height: 90px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); margin-bottom: 1rem; }

    /* ── MODAL ── */
    .modal-overlay { display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(42,10,16,0.55); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); z-index: 1000; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
    .modal-overlay.show { display: flex; }
    .modal { background: var(--blanc); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 0; width: 100%; max-width: 460px; max-height: 90vh; overflow-y: auto; box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(42,10,16,0.35); animation: modalIn 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1); }
    @keyframes modalIn { from { opacity:0; transform:translateY(40px) scale(0.95); } to { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0) scale(1); } }
    .modal-header { padding: 1.75rem 1.75rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--creme-dark); padding-bottom: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .modal-title { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--bordeaux); margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
    .modal-sub { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--brun-light); font-style: italic; }
    .modal-body { padding: 0 1.75rem 1.75rem; }
    .modal-foot { display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; }
    .modal-foot .btn { margin-bottom: 0; }

    /* Confirm dialog custom */
    .confirm-overlay { display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(42,10,16,0.6); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); z-index: 2000; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
    .confirm-overlay.show { display: flex; }
    .confirm-box { background: var(--blanc); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 2rem; max-width: 380px; width: 90%; box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(42,10,16,0.35); animation: modalIn 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1); text-align: center; }
    .confirm-icon { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
    .confirm-title { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--brun); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .confirm-text { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--brun-light); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.6; }
    .confirm-actions { display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; }
    .confirm-actions .btn { margin-bottom: 0; }

    /* ── TOAST ── */
    .toast { position: fixed; bottom: 2rem; right: 2rem; padding: 0.875rem 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 600; z-index: 9999; transform: translateY(120px) scale(0.9); opacity: 0; transition: all 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; max-width: 360px; }
    .toast.show { transform: translateY(0) scale(1); opacity: 1; }
    .toast.success { background: var(--bordeaux-dark); color: #fff; border-left: 4px solid var(--or); }
    .toast.error   { background: var(--rouge); color: #fff; }
    .toast.warning { background: var(--orange); color: #fff; }
    .toast-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--or); flex-shrink: 0; }
    .toast.error .toast-dot   { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); }
    .toast.warning .toast-dot { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); }

    /* ── FOOTER ── */
    .footer { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; color: var(--brun-light); font-size: 0.75rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--creme-dark); font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-style: italic; }
    .footer a { color: var(--or); text-decoration: none; }

    /* ── ANIMATIONS ── */
    .fade-in { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px); animation: fadeUp 0.5s ease forwards; }
    @keyframes fadeUp { to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
    .fade-in-1 { animation-delay: 0.05s; }
    .fade-in-2 { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
    .fade-in-3 { animation-delay: 0.15s; }
    .fade-in-4 { animation-delay: 0.2s; }

    /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hdr-nav { display: none; }
      .stats-strip { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .cards-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .res-ticket { flex-direction: column; }
      .res-date-col { flex-direction: row; gap: 1rem; min-width: unset; }
      .res-actions-col { flex-direction: row; border-left: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--creme-dark); min-width: unset; }
      .stats-strip { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<%
  var telAffiche    = user.telephone_client || user.telephone || '';
  var prenomAffiche = user.prenom_client    || user.prenom    || '';
  var nomAffiche    = user.nom_client       || user.nom       || '';
  var userId        = user.id_client        || user.id        || '';
  var initiale      = prenomAffiche ? prenomAffiche[0].toUpperCase() : user.email[0].toUpperCase();
  var nomComplet    = (prenomAffiche && nomAffiche) ? prenomAffiche + ' ' + nomAffiche : prenomAffiche || user.email.split('@')[0];
%>

<!-- Header -->
<header class="hdr">
  <a href="/" class="hdr-logo">Le <span>Gourmet</span> Parisien</a>
  <nav class="hdr-nav">
    <a href="/">Accueil</a>
    <a href="/carte">Notre carte</a>
    <a href="/reservation">Reserver</a>
    <a href="/avis">Avis</a>
  </nav>
  <div class="hdr-right">
    <span class="hdr-name"><%= prenomAffiche || user.email.split('@')[0] %></span>
    <div class="hdr-avatar"><%= initiale %></div>
    <a href="/logout" class="hdr-logout" title="Deconnexion">&#9211;</a>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-ring hero-ring-1"></div>
  <div class="hero-ring hero-ring-2"></div>
  <div class="hero-ring hero-ring-3"></div>
  <div class="hero-content">
    <p class="hero-eyebrow">Espace membre</p>
    <h1 class="hero-title">Bienvenue,<br><em><%= prenomAffiche || user.email.split('@')[0] %></em></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Retrouvez vos reservations et gerez votre profil</p>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-wave"></div>
</section>

<!-- Stats -->
<div class="stats-strip">
  <div class="stat-card fade-in fade-in-1">
    <div class="stat-val" id="stat-upcoming">—</div>
    <div class="stat-lbl">A venir</div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-card fade-in fade-in-2">
    <div class="stat-val" id="stat-total">—</div>
    <div class="stat-lbl">Total</div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-card fade-in fade-in-3">
    <div class="stat-val" id="stat-honoree">—</div>
    <div class="stat-lbl">Visites honorees</div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-card fade-in fade-in-4">
    <div class="stat-val" id="stat-annulee">—</div>
    <div class="stat-lbl">Annulees</div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Main -->
<main class="main">

  <!-- Prochaines reservations -->
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="section-title">Prochaines reservations</span>
    <span class="section-badge" id="upcoming-badge">0</span>
    <div class="section-line"></div>
  </div>

  <div id="upcoming-list">
    <div class="skeleton skel-ticket"></div>
    <div class="skeleton skel-ticket" style="opacity:.6;animation-delay:.15s"></div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top:1rem;">
    <a href="/reservation" class="btn btn-gold" style="display:inline-flex;width:auto;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;padding:0.8rem 1.75rem;">
      &#43; Nouvelle reservation
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- Profil + Avis en grid -->
  <div class="section-head" style="margin-top:3rem;">
    <span class="section-title">Mon profil</span>
    <div class="section-line"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="cards-grid">

    <!-- Profil card -->
    <div class="card fade-in">
      <div class="card-head">
        <div class="card-icon">&#128100;</div>
        <span class="card-title">Informations personnelles</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <!-- Membership card -->
        <div class="profil-membership">
          <div class="profil-membership-content">
            <div class="profil-membership-label">Membre</div>
            <div class="profil-membership-name" id="pm-name"><%= nomComplet || '—' %></div>
            <div class="profil-membership-email"><%= user.email %></div>
            <div class="profil-membership-chip">&#10022; Client fidele</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="profil-fields">
          <div class="profil-row">
            <div class="profil-field">
              <div class="profil-field-lbl">Prenom</div>
              <div class="profil-field-val" id="pf-prenom">
                <% if (prenomAffiche) { %><%= prenomAffiche %><% } else { %><span class="profil-field-empty">Non renseigne</span><% } %>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="profil-field">
              <div class="profil-field-lbl">Nom</div>
              <div class="profil-field-val" id="pf-nom">
                <% if (nomAffiche) { %><%= nomAffiche %><% } else { %><span class="profil-field-empty">Non renseigne</span><% } %>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="profil-field full">
            <div class="profil-field-lbl">Telephone</div>
            <div class="profil-field-val" id="pf-tel">
              <% if (telAffiche) { %>
                &#128222; <%= telAffiche %>
              <% } else { %>
                <span class="profil-field-empty">Non renseigne — Modifier pour ajouter</span>
              <% } %>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="openModalProfil()">&#9998; Modifier mon profil</button>
        <div class="or-sep">ou</div>
        <button class="btn btn-subtle" onclick="openModalPassword()">&#128274; Changer le mot de passe</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Avis card -->
    <div class="card fade-in" style="animation-delay:0.1s;">
      <div class="card-head">
        <div class="card-icon">&#11088;</div>
        <span class="card-title">Laisser un avis</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <div class="fbk" id="avis-fbk"></div>
        <form id="form-avis">
          <div class="fgroup">
            <label class="flabel">Votre experience</label>
            <div class="stars">
              <button type="button" class="star-btn active" data-val="1">&#9733;</button>
              <button type="button" class="star-btn active" data-val="2">&#9733;</button>
              <button type="button" class="star-btn active" data-val="3">&#9733;</button>
              <button type="button" class="star-btn active" data-val="4">&#9733;</button>
              <button type="button" class="star-btn active" data-val="5">&#9733;</button>
            </div>
            <span class="star-hint" id="star-hint">Excellent !</span>
            <input type="hidden" id="note-val" value="5">
          </div>
          <div class="fgroup">
            <label class="flabel">Commentaire</label>
            <textarea name="commentaire_avis" class="finput" rows="5" placeholder="Partagez votre experience avec nos futurs clients..."></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Envoyer mon avis</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- RGPD card -->
    <div class="card fade-in" style="animation-delay:0.2s;">
      <div class="card-head">
        <div class="card-icon">&#128274;</div>
        <span class="card-title">Confidentialite &amp; RGPD</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:0.98rem;color:var(--brun-light);font-style:italic;line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding:1rem 1.1rem;background:var(--creme);border-radius:var(--radius-xs);border-left:3px solid var(--or);border-bottom-left-radius:0;border-top-left-radius:0;">
          Conformement au RGPD, vous disposez d'un droit de suppression de vos donnees. Cette action est definitive et irreversible.
        </p>
        <button class="btn btn-danger" onclick="confirmDelete()">&#128465; Supprimer mon compte</button>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Historique -->
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="section-title">Historique</span>
    <span class="section-badge" id="history-badge">0</span>
    <div class="section-line"></div>
  </div>

  <div style="background:var(--blanc);border:1px solid var(--creme-dark);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow);">
    <div id="history-list">
      <div class="skeleton skel-ticket" style="margin:1rem;border-radius:8px;height:48px;"></div>
      <div class="skeleton skel-ticket" style="margin:1rem;border-radius:8px;height:48px;opacity:.6;animation-delay:.1s;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

</main>

<footer class="footer">Le Gourmet Parisien — 2026 — <a href="/">Retour au site</a></footer>

<!-- Modal profil -->
<div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-profil">
  <div class="modal">
    <div class="modal-header">
      <h3 class="modal-title">Modifier mon profil</h3>
      <p class="modal-sub">Mettez a jour vos informations personnelles</p>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-body">
      <div class="fbk" id="profil-fbk"></div>
      <form id="form-profil">
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0.75rem;">
          <div class="fgroup">
            <label class="flabel">Prenom *</label>
